OL,3,AUkrainian evacuees reunite with family
OL,4,Aafter years trapped in Russia-occupied
OL,5,Acity
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were raw emotional scenes as
OL,8,Fpeople evacuated from the devastated
OL,9,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky
OL,10,Fcrossed from Belarus into the Ukrainian
OL,11,Fregion of Chernihiv.
OL,13,FFamilies cried as they reunited with
OL,14,Frelatives they had not seen for years,
OL,15,Fwith two sisters running and crying out
OL,16,Fas they embraced their father.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
